00175","district":5,"fullName":"Rep. Ogles, Andrew [R-TN-5]","party":"R","state":"TN"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-01-13","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Make Greenland Great Again Act</strong></p><p>This bill authorizes the President to seek to enter into negotiations with Denmark to acquire Greenland.</p><p>If such an agreement is reached, the President must transmit the agreement and related materials to Congress within five calendar days.&nbsp;The agreement shall go into effect 60 calendar days after such transmission unless Congress enacts a joint resolution of disapproval.</p>","updateDate":"2025-02-27T19:54:41Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Make Greenland Great Again Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-09-19T23:07:45Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-09-19T23:07:45Z"}
